Have you seen any smoky potions?  If yes, is it something you can
alchemy for and then bless?  If no, how many have you identified, and
can you alchemy for the missing types?  One of those should be smoky. 
Don't forget to bless it--and (hopefully) wish for GDSM or [CoMR,
depending on your style.

You're a priest, right?  Have you been lucky enough to find a
spellbook of create monster?  If so, start sacrificing.  A lot.  You
may eventually get a smoky potion as randomized treasure.  Heck, you
might get a [CoMR as random treasure, though that would be
ridiculously lucky.

Do you have telepathy or an amulet of ESP?  Blind yourself and kill
Medusa by brute force, and hope for the [SoR in Perseus' statue.  (For
reflection, not MR--my first ascension got her first reflection this
way.)  Of course, if you have any ?oID laying around, and any unID'd
amulets, one of them may well be reflection.


